  "implementation_note": "This is the HyperSIGMA demo_seg_hypersigma-style dense pixel classifier: for Indian Pines it uses centered segmentation crops for training and overlapping tile-logit fusion for evaluation; for larger scenes it falls back to scene tiles. Training uses masked pixel CE with spectral/metadata-gated four-level feature fusion. Optional HyperSIGMA-style PCA preprocessing is applied on the normalized full cube before splitting when requested. The Aware-specific additions are metadata-conditioned encoder initialization and optional frozen ground prototype auxiliary regularization on training tiles only, plus optional class-balanced CE during fine-tuning."
